				<crossref let="g" cid="c19104029.58">
				</crossref>
				face, they are dismayed; when you take away their breath, they die and return to their dust.
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19104030">
			</marker>
			<v n="30">
				When you 
				<crossref let="h" cid="c19104030.59">
				</crossref>
