			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19104035">
			</marker>
			<v n="35">
				Let sinners 
				<crossref let="r" cid="c19104035.69">
				</crossref>
				be consumed, 
				<crossref let="s" cid="c19104035.70">
				</crossref>
				from the earth, and let the wicked be no more! Bless the LORD, O my soul! Praise the LORD! Footnotes (1) 104:19 Or *the appointed times* (compare Genesis 1:14) (2) 104:26 Or *you formed to play with* (3) 104:30 Or *breath* (ESV)
			</v>
